<title>GREECE: U.S. EMBASSY TO HOLD ANNUAL GREEK-AMERICAN BUSINESS AWARDS.</title>
<headline>U.S. EMBASSY TO HOLD ANNUAL GREEK-AMERICAN BUSINESS AWARDS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. embassy's commercial service and the American Hellenic Chamber of Commerce will hold their annual Greek-American business awards on December 12 at the Grande Bretagne Hotel.</p>
<p>Greek American businesses will be given awards for business of the year, social awareness, new product/service and emerging company, a U.S. commercial service statement said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
